{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35710","headline":"昇天行 · 李咸用","name":"昇天行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂堂削玉青蝇喧，寒鸦啄鼠愁飞鸾。\n梳玄洗白逡巡间，兰言花笑俄衰残。\n盘金束紫身属官，强仁小德终无端。\n不如服取长流丹，潜神却入黄庭闲。\n志定功成飞九关，逍遥长揖辞人寰。\n空中龙驾时回旋，左云右鹤翔翩联。\n双童树节当风翻，常娥倚桂开朱颜。\n河边牛子星郎牵，三清宫殿浮晴烟。\n玉皇据案方凝然，仙官立仗森幢幡。\n引余再拜归仙班，清声妙色视听安。\n飡和饮顺中肠宽，虚无之乐不可言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}